      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSpacious 3 Bed/3 Reception Bungalow with Detached Garage on Elevated C. 0.61 Acre Roadside Site in Scenic Rural Area. An Ideal Home. Requires Some Cosmetic Improvements Qualifies for Vacant Property Grant. C.8.5km to Amenities at Swanlinbar. For Sale By Private Treaty.\n\n \n\nThe well laid out living accommodation extends to C. 103 sqm/1,100 sqft and comprises;\n\nEntrance Hall, Snug Lounge (3.8 x 2.6) with open fireplace and double door leading to Sitting Room (4.0 x 3.3) with solid fuel stove, Modern Kitchen (4.0 x 3.7) with solid fuel range Hot Press, Dining Room (4.0 x 2.9), Rear Hall (1.8 x 1.0), Shower Room (1.8 x 1.8), Bedroom 1 (4.7 x 3.0), Bedroom 2 (3.2 x 3.0) and Bedroom 3 (2.7 x 2.7).\n\n \n\nThe is a large detached garage/workshop (8.8 x 5.7) with double door entrance and externally accessed store room (1.7 x 1.7).\n\n \n\nConstructed in 1984, the bungalow is of standard block construction with tile roof, plaster exterior finish and uPVC double glazed windows and doors. Fully habitable but requiring cosmetic renovation upgrades in some rooms.\n\n \n\nThose seeking more space can extend up to 45sqm the rear, exempt from planning permission. The property also qualifies for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant SEAI Energy Efficiency Grants amongst others.\n\n \n\nServiced by: Electrical connection, Corlough Group Water Scheme connection, Oil fired central heating On-site septic tank. Fibre broadband connection available. BER: C.\n\n \n\nThis 0.61 acre freehold site is located in an elevated scenic location with extensive frontage onto the R200 with panoramic views over the surrounding countryside. The mature parcel has large garden areas, concrete drive yard providing ample off-street parking complete with a large 8.8 x 5.7 (50sqm) detached garage workshop. Providing great potential for gardeners those seeking a place to work from home.\n\n \n\nSituated in the Unesco Cuilcagh Lakelands Geopark, along the R200 in a scenic rural location 8.5km to amenities in Swanlinbar. C.15 min drive to Ballyconnell and approx. 30 min to a wide range of amenities in Enniskillen 40 mins to Cavan Town. Convenient to Brackley Amenities, Cuilcagh Boardwalk, Shannon Pot Shannon-Erne Blueway. 2 Hours to Belfast Dublin. GPS: 54.157358, -7.775463.\n\n \n\nViewing Highly Recommended By Appointment Only. \n\n \n\n \n\n"
      }
